    {
      "id": "gh_secrets_sync",
      "name": "同步Git Secrets",
      "keys": [
        "github_pat",
        "github_repo"
      ],
      "author": "許諾",
      "repo": "https://github.com/Crack22/loon-plugins",
      "icons": [
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Crack22/loon-plugins/main/icons/gh-secrets.jpg"
      ],
      "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Crack22/loon-plugins/main/loon-gh-sync/github_secrets_sync.js",
      "descs_html": [
        "把 BoxJs 里的签到账号传到 GitHub 仓库的 Secrets 里，GitHub Actions 每天 09:00 自动签到，不用挂梯子，手机关机也能签。本地 Loon 插件保持不变，两边同时跑，先签到的那个生效。",
        "先创建一个 Token：<a href=\"https://github.com/settings/tokens?type=beta\">点这里创建 Fine-grained Token</a>，选 Only select repositories → loon-plugins，Repository permissions 里 Secrets 选 Read and write，然后把 Token 粘贴到下面的「GitHub Token」。",
        "填好后在 Loon 里点这个插件的脚本手动运行一次，就会上传（空着的账号不会上传）。以后账号换了，再运行一次就行。",
        "Loon 插件：<a href=\"loon://import?plugin=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Crack22/loon-plugins/main/loon-gh-sync/GitHubSecretsSync.plugin\">点击安装</a>"
      ],
      "settings": [
        {
          "id": "github_pat",
          "name": "GitHub Token",
          "val": "",
          "type": "password",
          "desc": "在 GitHub 上创建一个 Fine-grained Token，只给 loon-plugins 仓库 Secrets 的读写权限，粘贴到这里，不要发给任何人"
        },
        {
          "id": "github_repo",
          "name": "仓库",
          "val": "",
          "type": "text",
          "desc": "格式：用户名/仓库名"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "loon_config_backup",
      "name": "Loon配置状态备份",
      "keys": [
        "loon_backup_pat",
        "loon_backup_repo"
      ],
      "author": "許諾",
      "repo": "https://github.com/Crack22/loon-plugins",
      "icons": [
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Crack22/loon-plugins/main/icons/loon-backup.jpg"
      ],
      "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Crack22/loon-plugins/main/loon-config-backup/loon_config_backup.js",
      "descs_html": [
        "每天 04:00 自动把 Loon 当前运行配置（运行模式、各策略组、每个策略组当前选的节点、各组节点名）保存到你的私人 GitHub 仓库，单个文件 loon-config-state.json，有变化才提交。",
        "注意：Loon 不允许脚本读取完整的 .conf 文件，所以这份备份不含节点账号密码、订阅地址、规则、脚本原文。完整配置请在 Loon 里手动导出 .conf 后放进同一个私人仓库。",
        "先创建一个 Token：<a href=\"https://github.com/settings/tokens?type=beta\">点这里创建 Fine-grained Token</a>，选 Only select repositories → loon-config-backup，Repository permissions 里 Contents 选 Read and write，然后把 Token 粘贴到下面的「GitHub Token」。",
        "仓库填 用户名/仓库名，例如 Crack22/loon-config-backup。填好后点一下这个 App 就能立即备份一次。",
        "Loon 插件：<a href=\"loon://import?plugin=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Crack22/loon-plugins/main/loon-config-backup/LoonConfigBackup.plugin\">点击安装</a>"
      ],
      "settings": [
        {
          "id": "loon_backup_pat",
          "name": "GitHub Token",
          "val": "",
          "type": "password",
          "desc": "在 GitHub 上创建一个 Fine-grained Token，只给私人备份仓库 Contents 的读写权限，粘贴到这里，不要发给任何人"
        },
        {
          "id": "loon_backup_repo",
          "name": "备份仓库",
          "val": "",
          "type": "text",
          "desc": "格式：用户名/仓库名，例如 Crack22/loon-config-backup"
        }
      ]
    },
